it in the very early morning, and during a stretch of cooler days in the summer season.', null, null, '24', '36', '36', '36', '|', null, 'Lotus scoparius', null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Acmispon+glaber', 'https://calscape.org/Acmispon-glaber-%28Deer-Plant%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Acmispon-glaber-%28Deer-Plant%29.png');
