s://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Agoseris+aurantiaca', 'https://calscape.org/Agoseris-aurantiaca-%28Orange-Flowered-Agoseris%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Agoseris-aurantiaca-%28Orange-Flowered-Agoseris%29.png');
