.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Allium+acuminatum', 'https://calscape.org/Allium-acuminatum-%28Taper-Tipped-Onion%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Allium-acuminatum-%28Taper-Tipped-Onion%29.png');
