 Pacific Mountain', 'Pacific Onion,Swamp Onion,Wild Onion', null, 'Common', 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Allium+validum', 'https://calscape.org/Allium-validum-%28Pacific-Mountain-Onion%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Allium-validum-%28Pacific-Mountain-Onion%29.png');
