ame=Antennaria+dimorpha', 'https://calscape.org/Antennaria-dimorpha-%28Low-Pussytoes%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Antennaria-dimorpha-%28Low-Pussytoes%29.png');
