.68000000000001', '<p>Prefers sun or part shade. Likes moist places.</p>', null, 'Usually obtained by buying commercially available corms. For propagating by seed: No treatment. Plants from seed require 2-3 years to flower. To expand a population in your garden, dig mature corms in the fall and carefully divide the offset corms.', '24', '24', '6', '6', 'Brodiaea, Harvest', 'Elegant Clusterlily,Elegant Cluster-lily', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Brodiaea+elegans', 'https://calscape.org/Brodiaea-elegans-%28Harvest-Brodiaea%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Brodiaea-elegans-%28Harvest-Brodiaea%29.png');
