p.</a>), <a href="/search/?plant=Triteleia%20(Genus)">Triteleia spp.</a>', 'Containers', 'Forest, Grassland, Woodland', 'Foothill Woodland, Mixed Evergreen Forest, Valley Grassland', 'Tolerates cold to -5&deg; F', '7*, 8, 9, 14*, 15*, 16*, 17*, 19*, 20*, 21*, 22*, 23*, 24*', 'Tolerates a variety of soils including sand and clay, but does not like too much organic matter', null, '6.0 - 7.0', null, null, 'Grasslands or openings in woodlands, typically in somewhat hilly terrain. Plant Communities: Coastal Prairie, Mixed Evergreen Woodland, Oak Woodland, Foothill Woodland, Valley Grassland', '0', '3965', '7.9400000000000004', '77.829999999999998', 'Requires fast draining soil. Prefers sun or part shade. Likes heavy soils.', null, 'For propagating by seed:  No treatment.', '24', '24', '6', '6', 'Mariposa Lily , Yellow', 'Yellow Mariposa', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Calochortus+luteus', 'https://calscape.org/Calochortus-luteus-%28Yellow-Mariposa-Lily%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Calochortus-luteus-%28Yellow-Mariposa-Lily%29.png');
