s, canyons and mesas below 4,000 ft., typically with heavy or rocky soil, usually under low-growing sub-shrubs where the flower can stand above surrounding vegetation.', '6', '6399', '4.6100000000000003', '51', 'Prefers sun. Likes heavy or rocky soil.', 'Gophers will eat most types of bulbs', 'For propagating by seed: No treatment. However, it takes at least 3 years to grow Calochortus bulbs from seed. It is faster to plant bulbs that are a few years old', '12', '36', '6', '6', 'Mariposa Lily , Weed''s', null, null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Calochortus+weedii', 'https://calscape.org/Calochortus-weedii-%28Weed%27s-Mariposa-Lily%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Calochortus-weedii-%28Weed%27s-Mariposa-Lily%29.png');
