tha leptosepala var. biflora|Caltha leptosepala ssp. howellii', null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Caltha+leptosepala', 'https://calscape.org/Caltha-leptosepala-%28Marsh-Marigold%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Caltha-leptosepala-%28Marsh-Marigold%29.png');
