- 8.0', null, null, 'Dry, rocky places typically near the coast but sometimes in interior mountains and canyons', '6', '4840', '0', '57.270000000000003', '<p>Prefers sun. Likes dry rocky soils.</p>', null, null, '12', '12', '240', '360', 'Morning Glory , Island | False Bindweed, Island', 'Island False Bindweed,Island Morning-glory', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Calystegia+macrostegia', 'https://calscape.org/Calystegia-macrostegia-%28Island-Morning-Glory%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Calystegia-macrostegia-%28Island-Morning-Glory%29.png');
