 at less than 41&deg;F. Remove from refrigerator and plastic bag when germination starts or in 3 mos.', '12', '24', null, null, 'Camas, Common', 'Camas,Small Camas,Common Camash,Quamash', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Camassia+quamash', 'https://calscape.org/Camassia-quamash-%28Common-Camas%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Camassia-quamash-%28Common-Camas%29.png');
