brush,Pine Indian Paintbrush,Wavy-leaf Paintbrush,Applegate''s Indian Paintbrush,Wavyleaf Indian Paintbrush', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Castilleja+applegatei', 'https://calscape.org/Castilleja-applegatei-%28Wavy-Leaved-Paintbrush%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Castilleja-applegatei-%28Wavy-Leaved-Paintbrush%29.png');
