. Sow with seeds of an herbaceous perennial as some Castilleja species are obligate parasites. Bouteloua gracilis has been recommended as host.', '24', '24', '24', '24', 'Paintbrush, Texas  | Indian Paintbrush, Indian', 'Woolly Indian Paintbrush,Woolly Paintbrush,Texas Indian Paintbrush', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Castilleja+foliolosa', 'https://calscape.org/Castilleja-foliolosa-%28Texas-Paintbrush%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Castilleja-foliolosa-%28Texas-Paintbrush%29.png');
