ub, spring-moist areas, openings in evergreen forest or oak woodlands, and grasslands', '2', '6300', '10.880000000000001', '167.94', 'Prefers sun. Likes spring-moist, soils.', null, 'Seed germinates readily. Best if sowed in masses or drifts', '24', '36', null, null, 'Clarkia, Amonena | Farewell To Spring, Amonena', 'Farewell-to-spring,Godetia', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Clarkia+amoena', 'https://calscape.org/Clarkia-amoena-%28Farewell-To-Spring%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Clarkia-amoena-%28Farewell-To-Spring%29.png');
