eps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Clarkia+gracilis', 'https://calscape.org/Clarkia-gracilis-%28Farewell-To-Spring%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Clarkia-gracilis-%28Farewell-To-Spring%29.png');
