', '5.8799999999999999', '95.640000000000001', null, null, 'Because this is an annual, it is best propagated from seed in fall in an area that has already been cleared of weeds. A very light layer of organic mulch will allow seedlings to push through. It will typically reseed itself each year.', '36', '36', '36', '36', 'Clarkia, Elegant | Farewell To Spring, Elegant', 'Woodland Clarkia', null, 'Common', 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Clarkia+unguiculata', 'https://calscape.org/Clarkia-unguiculata-%28Elegant-Clarkia%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Clarkia-unguiculata-%28Elegant-Clarkia%29.png');
