000000000000001', '57.270000000000003', 'Requires fast draining soil. Prefers sun. Likes sandy or gravelly soils.', null, 'Use caution if attempting to propagate this plant from seeds because the toxin is concentrated in the seeds. Use caution in handling or storing seeds for fruits, and especially keep away from children or pets.&nbsp;&nbsp;For propagating by seed:  No treatment. (Everett 1957).', '12', '60', '72', '72', 'Jimsonweed, Devil''s weed, Moonflower', 'Toloache,Tolguacha,Momoy,Samay e''nurr Indian Apple,Sacred Thorn-apple,Western Jimsonweed,California Jimsonweed', 'Moonflower|Datura meteloides', null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Datura+wrightii', 'https://calscape.org/Datura-wrightii-%28Sacred-Datura%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Datura-wrightii-%28Sacred-Datura%29.png');
