 cold to 20&deg; F', '15*, 16*, 17*, 22*, 23*, 24*', 'Tolerates a variety of soils as long as drainage is good', null, '5.1 - 8.2', null, null, 'Seasonally dry coastal plains, canyons, foothills and valleys of southern California. Occasionally in disturbed areas.', '6', '5078', '5.0099999999999998', '49.289999999999999', 'Prefers sun or part shade. Likes grassy areas.', null, 'By seed', '36', '36', '24', '24', 'Tarweed, Clustered', null, 'Hemizonia fasciculata', 'Common', 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Deinandra+fasciculata', 'https://calscape.org/Deinandra-fasciculata-%28Clustered-Tarweed%29-2', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Deinandra-fasciculata-%28Clustered-Tarweed%29-2.png');
