lerates a variety of garden soils', null, null, null, null, 'Grassy and open places', '38', '12735', '10.199999999999999', '160.97', 'Requires fast draining soil. Prefers sun or part shade. Likes grassy areas.', null, 'Can be grown from seed but more commonly from an established corm', '36', '36', '12', '12', 'Hyacinth, Wild', 'Many-flowered Brodiaea,Manyflower Brodiaea,Roundtooth Snakelily', 'Brodiaea multiflora', null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Dichelostemma+multiflorum', 'https://calscape.org/Dichelostemma-multiflorum-%28Wild-Hyacinth%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Dichelostemma-multiflorum-%28Wild-Hyacinth%29.png');
