nches of water per year, and a maximum of 35 inches of water per year once established. Requires moist soil. It is moderately tolerant of full shade. Prefers part shade.This plant needs regular summer water.  If prefers to be watered 1-2 times per week.', null, 'Under suitable conditions it readily re-seeds itself', '24', '24', '12', '12', 'Sticky Cinquefoil| Gland Cinquefoil', 'Common Cinquefoil,Gland Cinquefoil', 'Potentilla glandulosa', 'Common', 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Drymocallis+glandulosa', 'https://calscape.org/Drymocallis-glandulosa-%28Sticky-Cinquefoil%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Drymocallis-glandulosa-%28Sticky-Cinquefoil%29.png');
