keley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Eriogonum+elatum', 'https://calscape.org/Eriogonum-elatum-%28Tall-Buckwheat%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Eriogonum-elatum-%28Tall-Buckwheat%29.png');
