ogonum+kennedyi', 'https://calscape.org/Eriogonum-kennedyi-%28Kennedy%27s-Buckwheat%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Eriogonum-kennedyi-%28Kennedy%27s-Buckwheat%29.png');
