ne Forest, Valley Grassland, Yellow Pine Forest', 'Tolerates cold to 5° F', null, 'Tolerates clay soil', null, '5.0 - 8.0', 'Tolerates sodic soil.', 'Organic with Rocks', 'Openings in woodlands or shrublands, in a variety of settings from coastal bluffs to inland hills and canyons', '6', '8864', '0', '131.36000000000001', '<p>Prefers full sun and good drainage. It is stressdeciduous. Tolerates alkaline soil and clay. It likes summer water every other week.</p>', null, 'By seeds or cuttings', '24', '24', '24', '24', 'Yarrow, Yellow', 'Yellow Yarrow,Golden-yarrow', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Eriophyllum+confertiflorum', 'https://calscape.org/Eriophyllum-confertiflorum-%28Golden-Yarrow%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Eriophyllum-confertiflorum-%28Golden-Yarrow%29.png');
