lcareous soils, and requires only moderately fertile soils. Euthamia occidentalis is moderately drought tolerant. It requires a minimum of 16 inches of water per year, and a maximum of 32 inches of water per year once established. Requires moist soil. It does not tolerate shade well. Prefers sun. Likes wet soils.', null, null, '48', '72', null, null, 'Goldenrod, Western', 'Western Goldentop,Western Flat-topped Goldenrod,Grass-leaf Goldenrod,Western Fragrant Goldenrod', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Euthamia+occidentalis', 'https://calscape.org/Euthamia-occidentalis-%28Western-Goldenrod%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Euthamia-occidentalis-%28Western-Goldenrod%29.png');
