s, moderately tolerant of calcareous soils, and tolerant of infertile soils. <br/>It requires a minimum of 16 inches of water per year, and a maximum of 60 inches of water per year once established. Requires fast draining soil. It is moderately tolerant of shade. It does well in gardens with regular water and part shade.', null, 'Divide rooted runners and transplant.', '1', '4', '24', '36', 'Strawberry, Beach', 'Pacific Beach Strawberry,Sand Strawberry,Chilean Strawberry,Coastal Strawberry', 'Fragaria chiloensis ssp. lucida', null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Fragaria+chiloensis', 'https://calscape.org/Fragaria-chiloensis-%28Beach-Strawberry%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Fragaria-chiloensis-%28Beach-Strawberry%29.png');
