 well-drained soil', null, '6.0 - 7.0', null, null, 'Open, sandy rocky places in many settings, from coastal lowlands to higher mountains and from mesic to xeric', '0', '10662', '3.8100000000000001', '167.94', 'Prefers sun. Likes sandy rocky soils.', null, 'For propagating by seed:  No treatment; 2 wks. stratification improves germination ( Grant 1949).', '4', '36', null, null, 'Gilia, Blue Field', 'Blue Field-gilia,Bluehead Gilia', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Gilia+capitata', 'https://calscape.org/Gilia-capitata-%28Blue-Field-Gilia%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Gilia-capitata-%28Blue-Field-Gilia%29.png');
