ds of interior valleys, also mountains to 4,000 ft., coastal bluffs, and rocky cliffs on the Channel Islands', '1', '1224', '4.8399999999999999', '154.74000000000001', '<p>Requires moist soil. Prefers sun. Likes deep sandy or saline soils. This plant is not particularly drought tolerant. It likes summer water every 2-4 weeks.</p>', 'Highly resinous nature defends this plant against herbivory from insects.', 'For propagating by seed:  No treatment.', '24', '84', '36', '36', 'Gumweed, Great Valley', 'Common Gumplant,Great Valley Gumplant', 'Grindelia camporum var. camporum', null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Grindelia+camporum', 'https://calscape.org/Grindelia-camporum-%28Great-Valley-Gumweed%29-2', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Grindelia-camporum-%28Great-Valley-Gumweed%29-2.png');
