full shade well. Prefers part shade.', null, null, '48', '96', null, null, 'Parsnip, Cow', 'Common Cowparsnip', 'Heracleum lanatum', null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Heracleum+maximum', 'https://calscape.org/Heracleum-maximum-%28Cow-Parsnip%29-2', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Heracleum-maximum-%28Cow-Parsnip%29-2.png');
