s not tolerate shade well. Prefers sun. Likes rock crevices.', null, 'For propagating by seed:  No treatment. (Emery and Frey 1971).', '36', '48', null, null, 'Goldenaster, Hairy False', 'Hairy Goldenaster', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Heterotheca+villosa', 'https://calscape.org/Heterotheca-villosa-%28Hairy-False-Goldenaster%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Heterotheca-villosa-%28Hairy-False-Goldenaster%29.png');
