tion may improve germination (McLean 1967).', '24', '36', null, null, 'Hawkweed, White', 'Hawkweed,White-flowered Hawkweed', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Hieracium+albiflorum', 'https://calscape.org/Hieracium-albiflorum-%28White-Hawkweed%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Hieracium-albiflorum-%28White-Hawkweed%29.png');
