 '24', '36', null, null, 'Mares Tail, Common', 'Common Marestail,Common Mare''s-tail', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Hippuris+vulgaris', 'https://calscape.org/Hippuris-vulgaris-%28Common-Mares-Tail%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Hippuris-vulgaris-%28Common-Mares-Tail%29.png');
