umn sowings from frost. Will also reseed on its own.', '24', '24', '6', '6', 'Meadowfoam, Common', 'Common Meadow-foam,Douglas'' Meadowfoam,Poached Egg Plant', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Limnanthes+douglasii', 'https://calscape.org/Limnanthes-douglasii-%28Common-Meadowfoam%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Limnanthes-douglasii-%28Common-Meadowfoam%29.png');
