ull, null, 'Meadows, grasslands, openings in chaparral or any areas with heavy, moist soil.', '0', '4776', '3', '80.510000000000005', '<p>Prefers part shade.</p>', null, 'By seed. After flowering, seeds may be left to fall on the ground or collected to be sown the following season. For propagating by seed: Hot water, scarification, or soak in concentrated H2S04 for 6 to 8 hours; scarification or soaking may improve germination. Optimum Soil Temperature for Germination is 55F to 70F. Germination time is 15 to 75 days. Sowing Depth: 1/8".', '24', '48', '36', '36', 'Lupine, Succulent', 'Arroyo Lupine,Hollowleaf Annual Lupine', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Lupinus+succulentus', 'https://calscape.org/Lupinus-succulentus-%28Succulent-Lupine%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Lupinus-succulentus-%28Succulent-Lupine%29.png');
