 settings including coastal, mountains, and deserts', '-89', '8009', '0', '51.670000000000002', '<p>Prefers sun, part shade.</p>', null, null, '12', '12', '96', '96', 'Wishbone-Bush, Desert', 'Wishbone Bush,California Four O''clock', 'Mirabilis californica', null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Mirabilis+laevis', 'https://calscape.org/Mirabilis-laevis-%28Desert-Wishbone-bush%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Mirabilis-laevis-%28Desert-Wishbone-bush%29.png');
