 Oak Woodland', 'Tolerates cold to 15&deg; F', null, 'Prefers sandy, gravelly soil', null, '5.0 - 8.0', null, 'Inorganic', 'Sandy or gravelly places, dunes, desert washes to 7,500 ft.', '189', '10575', '2.6099999999999999', '56.200000000000003', 'Prefers sun or part shade. Likes sandy or gravelly soils.', null, null, '4', '31', '120', '120', 'Primrose, California', 'California Evening Primrose', 'Oenothera californica', null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Oenothera+avita', 'https://calscape.org/Oenothera-avita-%28California-Primrose%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Oenothera-avita-%28California-Primrose%29.png');
