ed:  No treatment. (Emery and Frey 1971).', '2', '16', '72', '72', 'Oregon oxalis', 'Redwood-Sorrel', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Oxalis+oregana', 'https://calscape.org/Oxalis-oregana-%28Redwood-Sorrel%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Oxalis-oregana-%28Redwood-Sorrel%29.png');
