a variety of soils as long as drainage is good', null, '6.0 - 7.5', 'Tolerates sodic soil.', 'Organic with Rocks', 'Near the coast, open grassy places, typically on slopes where drainage is good, usually as part of chaparral vegetation. Inland and at higher elevations it also occurs in openings in foothill woodland or pine forest.', '0', '7089', '5.0099999999999998', '160.97', '<p>Prefers sun or part shade.</p>', null, 'From cuttings. For propagating by seed: No treatment; 1 to 2 months stratification may improve germination.', '36', '60', '60', '60', 'Penstemon, Foothill', 'Bunchleaf Penstemon,Foothill Beardtongue', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Penstemon+heterophyllus', 'https://calscape.org/Penstemon-heterophyllus-%28Foothill-Penstemon%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Penstemon-heterophyllus-%28Foothill-Penstemon%29.png');
