ant of full shade. Prefers sun or part shade. Likes wet soils, stream banks sand meadows.', null, null, '24', '24', null, null, 'Buttercup, Alisma Leaved', 'Alisma-leaved Buttercup,Common Water-plantain Buttercup,Plantainleaf Buttercup', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Ranunculus+alismifolius', 'https://calscape.org/Ranunculus-alismifolius-%28Alisma-Leaved-Buttercup%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Ranunculus-alismifolius-%28Alisma-Leaved-Buttercup%29.png');
