rrow-leaved Ragwort,Groundsel,Arrowleaf Ragwort', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Senecio+triangularis', 'https://calscape.org/Senecio-triangularis-%28Arrowhead-Butterweed%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Senecio-triangularis-%28Arrowhead-Butterweed%29.png');
