ll, '5.0 - 8.0', 'Tolerates sodic soil.', null, 'Moist places primarily along the coast', '0', '3306', '14.43', '98.069999999999993', '<p>Requires moist soil and tolerates seasonal flooding. Prefers shade unless grown along coast ranges where it likes full sun. It likes summer water every other week.</p>', null, 'By seed', '8', '12', '6', '6', 'Grass, Yellow Eyed', 'California Golden-eyed Grass,Yellow-eyed Grass,Golden Blue-eyed Grass', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Sisyrinchium+californicum', 'https://calscape.org/Sisyrinchium-californicum-%28Yellow-Eyed-Grass%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Sisyrinchium-californicum-%28Yellow-Eyed-Grass%29.png');
