, Subalpine Forest, Foothill Woodland, open, grassy places, and disturbed sites', '2', '11401', '3.1800000000000002', '167.94', '<p>It likes summer water at least once per month, and at most twice per week. It does well when the soil is wet in March and drier in summer.</p>', null, null, '24', '60', '0', '0', 'Goldenrod, Threenerve|Goldenrod, Californica', 'Oreja De Liebre', 'Solidago californica', null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Solidago+velutina+subsp.+californica', 'https://calscape.org/Solidago-velutina-ssp.-californica-%28California-Goldenrod%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Solidago-velutina-ssp.-californica-%28California-Goldenrod%29.png');
