'https://calscape.org/Sphaeralcea-grossulariifolia-%28Gooseberryleaf-Globemallow%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Sphaeralcea-grossulariifolia-%28Gooseberryleaf-Globemallow%29.png');
