land, Lodgepole Forest, Red Fir Forest, Subalpine Forest, Valley Grassland, Yellow Pine Forest, Wetland-Riparian', 'Tolerates cold to -20° F', null, 'Tolerates a variety of soils including sand and clay as long as adequate moisture is present', null, '6.0 - 8.0', null, null, 'Wet places, ditches, marshes', '0', '2927', '3.1800000000000002', '117.20999999999999', '<p>Prefers sun. Likes wet soils.</p>', null, null, '36', '36', '36', '36', null, 'Common Verbena,Western Verbena,Western Vervain', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Verbena+lasiostachys', 'https://calscape.org/Verbena-lasiostachys-%28Vervain%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Verbena-lasiostachys-%28Vervain%29.png');
