in vermiculite. Reove germinating seeds at weekly intervals (Smart and Minore 1977)', '6', '60', null, null, null, 'Common Beargrass,Bear Grass,Squaw Grass,Soap Grass,Quip-quip', null, null, 'N', 'https://ucjeps.berkeley.edu/eflora/eflora_display.php?name=Xerophyllum+tenax', 'https://calscape.org/Xerophyllum-tenax-%28Beargrass%29', 'https://calscape.org/storage/app/media/qr/Xerophyllum-tenax-%28Beargrass%29.png');
